				"CHANGELOG.md": {
					"diff": "--- published/CHANGELOG.md\n+++ rebuilt/CHANGELOG.md\n@@ -2,13 +2,6 @@\n \n All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file. This project uses [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/).\n \n-## 3.3.0 (2018-03-16)\n-\n-### Notable Changes\n-\n-* Added ability for Linux users to shutdown and restart the server Homebridge is running ([#39](https://github.com/oznu/homebridge-config-ui-x/issues/39))\n-* Added ability for Linux users to access the terminal if `{\"linux\": {\"terminal\": true}}` is set in the `config.json`\n-\n ## 3.2.1 (2018-03-13)\n \n ### Bug Fixes\n",
